# Regression fixture for inc-upw.52. AutoPickupFloor's unidentified-magic branch
# (src/Player.cpp) must NOT auto-stow a grantless holy symbol, nor the shield a
# priest drops stamped with the same god emblem, while it still stows real
# unidentified magic. Read by tools/check_symbol_autopickup.sh.
#
# Route on seed 1: an orc barbarian; wizard-summon a base human to the east; add
# the priest template, whose EV_INITIALIZE creates an UNIDENTIFIED holy symbol
# (lib/mon2.irh, MakeMagical with no MakeKnown) and stamps its buckler with the
# same god emblem; genocide it so it drops the gear; step onto the tile so the
# pickup runs. @dump:before catches the loaded tile; @dump:after catches the
# view once the pickup has settled.
@include chargen.keys
w
y
@expect "Wizard Mode Options:"
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Humans"
@choose "Human"
RIGHT
ENTER
w
@choose "Add Template to Creature"
RIGHT
ENTER
@choose "Priest"
w
@choose "Genocide Everything"
RIGHT
@dump:before
SPACE
@dump:after
@quit
